# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-13
#. type: Title #
#, no-wrap
msgid "Generate SqDRIFT circuits {#generate-sqdrift-circuits}"
msgstr "Membuat circuit SqDRIFT {#generate-sqdrift-circuits}"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-13
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "With sample-based quantum diagonalization ([SQD](https://arxiv.org/abs/2405.05068)), you must choose an ansatz from which to sample bitstrings. The [SqDRIFT](https://arxiv.org/abs/2508.02578) variant uses an ensemble of time evolution circuits constructed directly from the target Hamiltonian instead. This is achieved by subsampling smaller time evolution operators from the Hamiltonian based on its coefficients, which is known as the [qDRIFT](https://arxiv.org/abs/1811.08017) Trotterization method.\n"
msgstr "Dengan sample-based quantum diagonalization ([SQD](https://arxiv.org/abs/2405.05068)), kamu harus memilih ansatz yang akan dijadikan sumber sampling bitstring. Varian [SqDRIFT](https://arxiv.org/abs/2508.02578) memakai ansambel circuit evolusi waktu yang dibangun langsung dari Hamiltonian target. Ini dicapai dengan men-subsampel operator evolusi waktu yang lebih kecil dari Hamiltonian berdasarkan koefisiennya, yang dikenal sebagai metode Trotterisasi [qDRIFT](https://arxiv.org/abs/1811.08017).\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-13
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "This getting started guide shows how to generate an ensemble of such randomized circuits.\n"
msgstr "Panduan memulai ini menunjukkan cara membuat ansambel circuit acak seperti itu.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "<span id=\"hamiltonian-setup\" />\n"
msgstr ""

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-13
#. type: Title ##
#, no-wrap
msgid "1. Hamiltonian setup {#1-hamiltonian-setup}"
msgstr "1. Penyiapan Hamiltonian {#1-hamiltonian-setup}"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-13
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "For the purposes of this guide, load the electronic structure Hamiltonian of N2 from an FCIDUMP file. There are other means of constructing the [`FermionOperator`](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/qiskit-fermions/operators-fermion-operator#qiskit_fermions.operators.FermionOperator \"qiskit_fermions.operators.FermionOperator\"). Be sure to consult its documentation, as well as the [`qiskit_fermions.operators.library`](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/qiskit-fermions/operators-library#module-qiskit_fermions.operators.library \"qiskit_fermions.operators.library\").\n"
msgstr "Untuk keperluan panduan ini, muat Hamiltonian struktur elektronik N2 dari file FCIDUMP. Ada cara lain untuk membangun [`FermionOperator`](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/qiskit-fermions/operators-fermion-operator#qiskit_fermions.operators.FermionOperator \"qiskit_fermions.operators.FermionOperator\"). Pastikan kamu membaca dokumentasinya, serta [`qiskit_fermions.operators.library`](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/qiskit-fermions/operators-library#module-qiskit_fermions.operators.library \"qiskit_fermions.operators.library\").\n"

